      "transcript_text": "Go on. Okay, high blood pressure, that's already on your record. Good to know. It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together.",
