      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Okay, that's done. So, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like heat exhaustion with some dehydration. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. It could also be an electrolyte imbalance, so we'll keep that open.",
